  #line-at(72.1pt, 501.45pt, "and slope of the IV characteristics [59,63]. ")
  #line-at(90.125pt, 527.73pt, "This distinction is particularly useful for LECO because the intended effect is a reduction ")
  #line-at(72.1pt, 548.72pt, "of the interfacial transport barrier through the formation and connectivity of conductive ")
