  #line-at(90.125pt, 255.97pt, "Electrically, this mode typically appears as a gradual increase in series resistance with a ")
  #line-at(72.1pt, 277pt, "corresponding low FF loss, sometimes punctuated by discrete resistance jumps if a small ")
  #line-at(72.1pt, 297.25pt, "number of dominant filaments degrade or open [116,117]. In early stages, ")
